Package: shellguard
Version: 2.2.3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl
Maintainer: ShellGuard <shellguard@merabytes.com>
Description: Shell and SSH session alerting daemon (pure sh)
 ShellGuard monitors for new interactive shells and SSH logins
 and sends real-time notifications via Telegram, Slack, or webhook.
 Zero Python dependency — runs on BusyBox, Synology NAS, Alpine,
 Debian and any POSIX system with sh and curl.
